# ===== Environment Files =====
# Commit .env.local, .env.test, .env.stage (no real secrets - safe for learning project)
# NEVER commit .env.prod in real projects - may contain real credentials
# For this DEMO project, .env.prod also committed (contains only dummy values)
environments/.env.real-prod
.env.real-prod

